WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:09.217
Hey, this is who I really am.
Sorry, you got the wrong guy.

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:12.137
You think you can fool me
by turning into an ugly dude?

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:16.099
I'm really not Mad Bark!
Why won't you believe me?

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:26.109
Super Invisibility!

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:36.119
Why did he disappear? Invisibility?

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:45.545
How can I let him get away?
How would I explain it to my master?

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:54.471
There's no invisibility.
This trick works every time.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.556
When she walks away, I will...

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.644
You again?

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.688
What do you want?

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:05.315
Hell, no!

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:13.323
It's rude to defecate in public places.

00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:19.079
You're quite tricky for a mutt.

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:20.371
Almost had me fooled.

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:27.420
I'm half of a durian.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.764
I already transformed
into so many things for you.

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:40.433
Why won't you just believe
that I'm not Mad Bark?

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:56.366
Wait, I have something to say.

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.202
Actually, I...

00:02:07.001 --> 00:02:08.545
Wow, pretty girl!

00:02:12.423 --> 00:02:15.009
I don't care if you're Mad Bark now.

00:02:16.052 --> 00:02:17.595
You're going to die.

00:02:18.054 --> 00:02:20.723
I'm Killer Seven.

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:24.644
I'm No. 17,369 on the killer ranking list.

00:02:24.727 --> 00:02:27.605
My specialty is to cut see-through bangs.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.608
My constant quality service
and affordable prices

00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:32.402
have always been popular
among the villagers.

00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:34.988
My current relationship status is single.

00:02:35.071 --> 00:02:36.573
Let's get a drink
and share our experiences as killers...

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:40.952
I just remembered that
I must go take care of something.

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:52.255
Peace out! The next tea is on me.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:55.133
Don't forget to call me!

